<group prefix="WebGpuSharp.FFI.">
    <comment location="TexelCopyTextureInfoFFI">
        <summary>            
            View of a texture which can be used to copy to/from a buffer.
        </summary>
    </comment>
    <group prefix="TexelCopyTextureInfoFFI.">
        <comment location="Texture">
            <summary>                
                The texture to be copied to/from.
            </summary>
        </comment>
        <comment location="MipLevel">
            <summary>                
                The target mip level of the texture.
            </summary>
        </comment>
        <comment location="Origin">
            <summary>                
                The base texel of the texture in the selected <see cref="WebGpuSharp.FFI.TexelCopyTextureInfoFFI.MipLevel"/>. 
                Together with the copySize argument to copy functions, defines the sub-region of the texture to copy.
            </summary>
        </comment>
        <comment location="Aspect">
            <summary>                
                The copy aspect.
            </summary>
        </comment>
    </group>
</group>